plier averages 1.046, not 1.\n- Candidates 5 and 0 order exactly the forecast (1.0 ×). On average they run short, and every missing unit costs 10 or 7.\n- Candidates 7 and 6 order about 1.2–1.3 × forecast. The plan is fixed in advance, so each cycle's surplus is added on top of the last. Over 30 days that pile of extra stock grows, gets written off at expiry (at least 5–9 per unit) and can hit the storage limit.\n- About 1.1 × (Candidates 1, 3 and 4) is the most balanced.\n\n**Choosing among the 1.1 × plans.** Candidate 3 orders daily and pays about 740 more in fees. Candidate 4 matches Candidate 1 in amounts and coverage, including the last days, but has one extra order day (−53). The first two days are short of stock for every plan equally, because the opening stock runs out before any order can arrive."}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 3911, "cache_read_input_tokens": 2269, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 3911}, "output_tokens": 5, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-26T09:13:27.065Z", "request_id": "req_011CgQbFpqsdxE3v1SVAk5Bo"}, {"type": "stream_event", "event": {"type": "content_block_stop", "index": 1}, "parent_tool_use_id": null}, {"type": "stream_event", "event": {"type": "content_block_start", "index": 2, "content_block": {"type": "tool_use", "id": "toolu_01XnqPyvfmKadjp4zAtoFk9q", "name": "StructuredOutput", "input": {}, "caller": {"type": "direct"}}}, "parent_tool_use_id": null}, {"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-opus-5-5", "id": "msg_011CgQbFq8ygjeAVboDN5ZhZ", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "tool_use", "id": "toolu_01XnqPyvfmKadjp4zAtoFk9q", "name": "StructuredOutput", "input": {